    // The general property: after initialize(...) returns successfully, c.baseToken() == _baseToken and c.nft() == _nft.
    // We fuzz _baseToken and _nft (addresses). The bug (swapped assignment order) can cause nft() to differ for some inputs.
    function testFuzz_property(address _baseToken, address _nft) public {
